  "subtitle": "Main flow: KOL proposes a personal code → owning Shop approves the discount policy.",
  "classNote": "Scope: assign and activate a personal KOL coupon. Discount preview and transactional redemption at checkout are described in FR12_CODE_ANALYSIS.md and the FR16 checkout flow.",
  "notes": [
    "Browser groups KolCouponsPage and ShopCouponsPage. JWT/role/DTO guards precede protected calls. KOL proposes the code; the owning SHOP_MANAGER sets the discount policy.",
    "Proposal requires an APPROVED partnership and commission policy. Coupon, proposal audit and notification are separate writes. Approval policy/scope changes use one transaction; approval audit/notification follow commit.",
    "Coupon owner determines KOL attribution when redeemed. Preview consumes no quota; checkout locks/revalidates coupon and writes usage, Order and redemption atomically. These later interactions are documented separately."
  ],
